OL,3,GNEWSAQueen Elizabeth II's former
OL,4,Apageant master dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former royal pageant master who
OL,7,Forganised beacon lighting ceremonies to
OL,8,Fmark major royal occasions for more
OL,9,Fthan 40 years has died.
OL,11,FBruno Peek, who lived in
OL,12,FGorleston-on-Sea, Norfolk, died on
OL,13,FSunday aged 75 following a long period
OL,14,Fof ill health.
OL,16,FEarlier in the year, he disclosed to
OL,17,Fthe BBC that seven weeks before
OL,18,FChristmas he had been diagnosed with an
OL,19,Fincurable blood cancer.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
